==================================================
26. ANIMATION
==================================================

Use subtle animation only.

Allowed:

- Fade-up on scroll
- Gentle image scale on hover
- Button hover transition
- Navigation transition
- Small arrow movement

Animation duration:
approximately 200–500ms.

Avoid:

- Parallax everywhere
- Spinning elements
- Excessive text animation
- Large page transitions
- Bouncing elements

The website should feel calm and premium.

